| Precision | 150/180 = **0.8333** |
| Recall | 150/200 = **0.75** |
| F1 | 300/380 = **0.7895** |
| Specificity | 770/800 = **0.9625** |

For a spam filter, precision matters most: 30 genuine emails went to spam, and each one is a message someone may never read.

