The 3 nearest houses (distance, price in lakh): (2, 52), (3, 48), (4, 60). Plain KNN regression: the **average**, (52 + 48 + 60)/3 = **53.33**. Distance-weighted (w = 1/d²: 0.25, 0.1111, 0.0625): Σw·price/Σw = **52.13**, pulled towards the nearest house.

