Parent: 3 Yes, 3 No, so H = **1** (a 50/50 split).

| Attribute | Branches | Weighted H | Gain |
|---|---|--:|--:|
| Weather | Rainy 1Y/2N (H = 0.9183); Sunny 2Y/1N (H = 0.9183) | 0.9183 | **0.0817** |
| Wind | High 0Y/2N (H = 0); Low 3Y/1N (H = 0.8113) | 0.5409 | **0.4591** |

**Wind** has the higher gain, so it is the root: its High branch is pure (both No).

