| Class | P(c) | P(free = Yes ∣ c) | P(link = Yes ∣ c) | Score | With Laplace smoothing |
|---|:-:|:-:|:-:|--:|---|
| Spam | 4/8 | 3/4 | 3/4 | 0.2812 | (3+1)/(4+2) × (3+1)/(4+2) × 4/8 = 0.2222 |
| Ham | 4/8 | 1/4 | 0/4 | 0 | (1+1)/(4+2) × (0+1)/(4+2) × 4/8 = 0.0278 |

Without smoothing, Ham scores exactly 0 because no Ham email had a link (P(link ∣ Ham) = 0/4), whatever the other feature says. Either way **Spam** wins; normalised with smoothing, P(Spam ∣ free, link) = 0.8889.

